    <string name="settings_privacy_section">Privacy</string>
    <string name="settings_privacy_body">Repeater.MY has no account, ads or analytics. It connects to the internet only to download the public repeater and callsign lists, map tiles, and (if you switch it on) the APRS station list. Your location is used on this phone to sort the list and is never sent anywhere.</string>
