    <string name="about_disclaimer_title">Disclaimer</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_position">The latitude and longitude listed for a repeater are approximate. They are used for distance and direction only and do not show the actual repeater site.</string>
    <string name="about_disclaimer_data">Repeater information is gathered from public sources, including amateur radio club websites, logbooks, publicly accessible databases and individual contributors. Frequencies, tones and locations may change without notice, so always confirm on air.</string>
